47d17c39dfed"],

Cell["\<\
Visualization of the Neimark-Sacker bifurcation found in the brachiating gait \
family under time-based switching. Again, unstable points are red and stable \
points are blue. The last 50 gaits of are plotted for a few unstable initial \
gaits. Invariant curves formed by these gaits are connected for visual \
clarity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9953191129671383`*^9, 3.995319324938436*^9}, {
  3.9953193731423693`*^9, 3.99531944874124*^9}, {3.9953195059379473`*^9, 
  3.995319637386601*^9}, {3.995319726910157*^9, 3.995319727130056*^9}, {
  3.995320568472077*^9, 
  3.995320572348652*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1c399789-3637-4ce1-a0a5-\
67a31e580e80"],

